# Advisories ignored by `mix deps.audit` (wired via the :audit alias in mix.exs).
# One advisory ID per line. Lines starting with `#` are comments.
#
# GHSA-rhv4-8758-jx7v — Decimal: unbounded exponent in `Decimal.new` enables
# unauthenticated DoS. Patched in decimal 3.0.0.
#
# Not exploitable here: `ocsf` never uses Decimal at runtime. `decimal` is a
# transitive, dev/test-only dependency (doctor, ex_json_schema) and an optional
# dep of jason, which `ocsf` never feeds Decimal values. The fix (3.0.0) is
# unreachable while doctor and ex_json_schema cap decimal at `~> 2.0`.
# Revisit when those deps widen their constraints.
GHSA-rhv4-8758-jx7v
